  1
Plate size is within the published primary dimensional context, but all geometry is independently authored. The four 16 mm studs sit on a 200 x 200 mm grid, extend 160 mm from the plate rear to their heads, and have 32 mm diameter x 10 mm heads. Their far face is 182 mm from the exposed plate face, leaving 138 mm to the opposite concrete face. A finite 12 mm bracket with a triangular stiffener is welded
